    <string name="os_pravno_besedilo">Safeer OS %1$s (%2$s)\n\nLICENCE. Safeer is open-source software under the Apache 2.0 licence, provided “as is”, without warranty.\n\nLIABILITY. You are responsible for what you use Safeer for and how, and for the content you reach or open with it. The author is not liable for any damage arising from its use. Safeer Shield, BankGuard and the threat lists are help, not a guarantee: they can miss a dangerous page and sometimes block a safe one.\n\nARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE. Artificial intelligence was used in developing this software. The code may therefore be wrong or incomplete; every release is tested, but errors cannot be ruled out. The source code is public so you can check it yourself: github.com/safeerOS</string>
