    <string name="os_spor_izberi_ponudnika">Where is your e-mail?</string>
    <string name="os_spor_ponudnik_drug">Other provider</string>
    <string name="os_spor_ponudnik_drug_opis">Type your address – we suggest the servers.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_ni_na_voljo">not available</string>
    <string name="os_spor_zamenjaj_ponudnika">‹ Other provider</string>
    <string name="os_spor_naslov_ponudnika">Your %1$s address</string>
    <string name="os_spor_geslo_aplikacije_polje">App password (16 characters)</string>
    <string name="os_spor_napredno">Servers (advanced)</string>
    <string name="os_spor_kaj_narediti">What you need to do</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_gmail">1. Open myaccount.google.com › Security and turn on 2-Step Verification.\n2. There, find “App passwords”, create one (name it e.g. Safeer) and copy the 16-character password.\n3. Enter your Gmail address and THAT password here (not your main one).\nIMAP is on by default in Gmail.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_yahoo">1. Open login.yahoo.com › Account security › “Generate app password”.\n2. Copy the generated password and enter it here instead of your main one.\nThe username is your full Yahoo address.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_icloud">1. Open account.apple.com › Sign-In and Security › “App-Specific Passwords” (two-factor authentication required).\n2. Create one for Safeer and enter it here instead of your Apple Account password.\nThe address is your full iCloud address.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_gmx">1. In webmail open Settings › POP3/IMAP and enable IMAP.\n2. Enter your address and your usual password here.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_zoho">1. In Zoho Mail open Settings › Mail Accounts › “IMAP Access” and enable it.\n2. If two-factor authentication is on, create an “App password” in your Zoho account and enter that.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_fastmail">1. In Fastmail open Settings › Privacy &amp; Security › Integrations › “New app password” (for mail).\n2. Enter your address and that app password.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_arnes">Enter your Arnes address and password. If sign-in fails, Safeer retries with the username without “@arnes.si” by itself.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_navadno">Enter your address and your usual mail password. Safeer knows the servers and ports. If sign-in fails, Safeer retries with the username without the domain by itself.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_oauth">Microsoft no longer allows password sign-in for personal accounts (OAuth sign-in is required, which Safeer does not have yet). Until then use the official Outlook app – “Apps” tab.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_nav_drug">Type your address – Safeer suggests imap.domain and smtp.domain. If your provider lists different servers, fix them under “Servers (advanced)”.</string>
    <string name="os_spor_poskus_brez_domene">Retrying with the username without the domain…</string>
